ph County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years. In 2025 that same pair ran 59% of normal, and November to December ran 50%. Grid 16078 had its driest year in 2007 at 52%.</p>"}
